---
title: Upgrade · app view of the flow
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Checking
  Checking --> Done : nothing remains
  Checking --> Blocked : blockers or incomplete
  Checking --> Ready : work remains
  Blocked --> Checking : Re-check
  Ready --> Snapshotting : Upgrade
  Snapshotting --> Blocked : gaps or refused
  Snapshotting --> Applying : complete
  Applying --> Unknown : no evidence
  Applying --> Failed : step failed
  Applying --> RestartingDaemon : steps verified
  RestartingDaemon --> Checking : versions match
  RestartingDaemon --> Failed : mismatch
  Failed --> RollingBack : Roll back
  RollingBack --> Restored : files restored
  RollingBack --> Failed : partial restore
  Restored --> Checking : re-check
  Unknown --> Checking : re-check
  note right of Restored
    INV rollback restores files only,
    never versions or containers
  end note
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef wait stroke-dasharray:2 2
  classDef fail stroke-width:2px
  class Done ok
  class Snapshotting,Applying,RestartingDaemon,RollingBack wait
  class Blocked,Failed,Unknown fail
